# Development-procedure skills. Local to each machine and tailored to whoever
# is working on the codebase right now, so they are not shared through git.
#
# The seven product skills already in .skills/ stay tracked on purpose: they are
# part of the product and other machines need them. Only these procedure skills
# are ignored, and they are untracked here so the ignore takes effect.
.skills/desarrollar-skill.md
.skills/verificar-rdd.md
.skills/cobertura.md
.skills/analisis-calidad.md

# CodeGraph index: derived from the sources, rebuilt with `codegraph init`.
.codegraph/
